:0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Currently when setting a key with the NX option, and the key already exists, we return an error instead of a null reply. Similarly, when setting a nonexistent key with the XX option, we return an error instead of a null reply.\r\n\r\nYB output:\r\n```\r\n127.0.0.1:6379> set k 1 nx\r\nOK\r\n127.0.0.1:6379> set k 1 nx\r\n(error) Unknown error\r\n```\r\n\r\nRedis output:\r\n```\r\n127.0.0.1:13412> set k 1 nx\r\nOK\r\n127.0.0.1:13412> set k 1 nx\r\n(nil)\r\n```\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"hectorgcr","id":20052555,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDUyNTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20052555?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr","html_url":"https://github.com/hectorgcr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/88/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/88/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}